1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:08,800
Let's slice the veg nice and thin, and
warm a little oil.

2
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:14,800
Pop the garlic in and let it soften, so
the oil smells amazing.

3
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:20,800
Now the mushrooms, onion and carrot. Let
them get a bit golden.

4
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:26,800
The udon is fresh, so it only needs a
quick dip in hot water.

5
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:32,800
Loosen the noodles with your hands, then
drain them really well.

6
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:38,800
For the teriyaki sauce, we mix it all in
a bowl. Soy sauce first.

7
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:44,800
Then the rice wine and the brown sugar.
Stir until it all melts.

8
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:50,800
Sear the prawns until they're pink, then
grill the secreto ibérico.

9
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:56,800
Tip the noodles in with the veg, and
toss everything together.

10
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:02,800
Prawns and pork back in, sauce over the
top, and some spring onion.

11
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:08,800
Keep tossing until every noodle is shiny
and coated.

12
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:14,800
Serve it up with spring onion on top.
Enjoy!
